<title>INDIA: India HDFC up 4.6 pct ahead of results.</title>
<headline>India HDFC up 4.6 pct ahead of results.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Housing Development and Finance Corporation (HDFC) rose sharply in early trade ahead of its results on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>Analysts expect net profits to rise to 250 million rupees in the year ended March 31, 1997, from 202.8 million a year ago.</p>
<p>The share jumped 144.95 rupees, or 4.6 percent, to 3,300 on the National Stock Exchange shortly after opening.</p>
<p>Trading on the Bombay exchange was delayed due to a technical problem.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
</text>
